   },
   "text": "Requirements\n\n- Your army must include at least 2 Rubric Marine units.\n- Your army must include at least 1 Chaos Lord.\n- Your army must include at least 1 Sorcerer Disciples unit.\n\nBenefits\n\n- You may field Chaos Champions as Elite choices.\n- You may field Sorcerer Disciples as Troops choices, but they gain the Support Squad special rule.\n- After deployment, when determining who will take the First Turn, you may force both players to re-roll the roll-off.",
